#
# === Composition with @time/future (light-cone geometry) ===
#
# @time/future (`shards/time/future.mirror`; Mara Round-2 landing)
# IS the future-light-cone at substrate-time altitude. Per @time/
# future docblock: "The future is not fantasy; the future is the
